==Description==
The '''DuckyBath Nametag''' is a nametag added as part of the [[Ducky Revenge Event]]. It was obtained by completing ''The Ducky went down to Georgia'' [[Mission Quests|Mission]].

The '''DuckyBath Nametag''' has an orange to yellow gradient text with a dark orange gradient. Multiple splashes of water, bubbles and rubber duckies appear out of the nametag.

==Trivia==
*The '''DuckyBath Nametag''' is the first nametag to be obtained from a [[Mission Quests|Mission]].
*The description for the '''DuckyBath Nametag''' description suggests it is obtained from the [[Ducky Revenge Event#Ducky Revenge Battle Pass|Ducky Revenge Battle Pass]], despite that not being true and as it is obtained from [[Mission Quests]] instead.

